<p class="govuk-body">In your court order, this is called <strong>alcohol treatment</strong>. It means you get support for alcohol use.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">The type of treatment will depend on your needs. This means you might need to attend appointments or treatment sessions.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">It is important to remember that if you do not take part in your <strong>alcohol treatment</strong>, you could go back to court.</p>
